WEBVTT

00:14:59.220 --> 00:15:02.640
You will be able to speak,
and the other person to understand.

00:15:02.640 --> 00:15:05.420
Those are the kinds of things we can do.

00:15:05.420 --> 00:15:08.450
(Applause)

00:15:11.710 --> 00:15:16.400
The most important thing Sundar said 
is that through Artificial Intelligence

00:15:16.400 --> 00:15:22.730
any Indian of any age and at any place
can speak to one another

00:15:22.730 --> 00:15:28.850
because according to him, human connection
is more important than any other.

00:15:28.860 --> 00:15:32.340
Technology can go anywhere,
but human connection is needed,